OL,3,ABlue plaque unveiled at home of
OL,4,APaddington creator
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe unveiling of a blue plaque at the
OL,7,Fformer Surrey home of Paddington Bear
OL,8,Fcreator Michael Bond was a "lovely"
OL,9,Foccasion with an unexpected surprise,
OL,10,Fthe organiser has said.
OL,12,FBond, who died in 2017 at the age of
OL,13,F91, moved to Fairacre in Haslemere in
OL,14,F1968, where he spent the next 10 years
OL,15,Fwriting several Paddington books
OL,16,Falongside the scripts for the original
OL,17,Ftelevision series.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
