OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABlue plaque unveiled at home of
OL,4,APaddington creator
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe unveiling on Saturday took place
OL,7,Fwith the permission of current owners,
OL,8,FSteph and Neil Stephenson, and was
OL,9,Fattended by Bond's daughter, Karen
OL,10,FJankel, who presented them with a
OL,11,Fspecial gift.
OL,13,F"It was the [Paddington] Bear that was
OL,14,FKaren's as a child," Haslemere Society
OL,15,Fchairman Chris Harrison said.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
